infinite-patch 1
# Synths: sounds from notes
node 1 Notes Random Note Generator
  id notes
  pos 0 302
  f rateBeats 0.5
end
node 2 Synths Wavetable
  id synth
  pos 480 318
end
node 3 Utility Audio Out
  id speakers
  pos 1640 302
end
node 4 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 0
  s text Synths turn notes into sound. Analog, Wavetable, Sampler and others all take notes in.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
node 5 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 156
  s text Plays a random note twice a beat.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 480 156
  s text The Wavetable synth morphs between wave shapes. Try Position to change the tone, and the Filter.
  f width 300
  f height 126
end
node 7 Compositing Comment
  pos 1640 156
  s text Sound reaches your speakers here.
  f width 300
  f height 110
end
note synth 0 notes
aud speakers 0 synth
